### Registrar (esperado: 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"estudiante2","password":"ClaveSegura123!"}

### Autenticar (esperado: 200)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"estudiante1","password":"ClaveSegura123!"}

### Sin token (esperado: 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secured

### Con token (esperado: 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secured
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}